plebian-os (0.2.3+packaging7) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Ship the WirePlumber video-only profile and the tasksel descriptor in
    the desktop packages. A packaged install leaves the portal file to
    plebian-desktop-base.
  * When task-pleb-desktop is installed, plebian-os-update uses apt.
    Rollback is the previous frozen suite.
  * The release image installs task-pleb-desktop from the disc and first
    boot uses the packaged pleb and kilix session.
  * A packaged first boot skips the build toolchain. The disc package
    list matches that runtime set. Checkout installs still get the compilers.

 -- itsmygithubacct <itsmygithubacct@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:26:46 +0000

